{"id":"allma_hlich","lemma":"allmählich","pos":"adv","rank":3976,"glosses":["gradually, little by little"],"ipa":"/ʔalˈmɛːlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/De-allm%C3%A4hlich2.ogg/De-allm%C3%A4hlich2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bist du allmählich fertig?","en":"Are you about ready?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"ready for use"}]},{"text":"Sind Sie allmählich fertig?","en":"Are you about ready?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"ready for use"}]},{"text":"Seid ihr allmählich fertig?","en":"Are you about ready?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"ready for use"}]},{"text":"Es wird draußen allmählich dunkel.","en":"It's gradually getting dark outside.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"outside"},null,{"g":"dark"}]},{"text":"Ich verlor allmählich die Hoffnung.","en":"I was starting to lose hope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469913","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to lose","l":"verlieren"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"hope"}]}]}